{
  "plan": {
    "version": "0.1",
    "title": "余弦函数与单位圆投影",
    "goals": [
      "理解单位圆中动点的 x 轴投影代表余弦值 cos θ 及其随角度变化的周期规律",
      "通过单位圆旋转与正弦曲线平移关系推导诱导公式 cos θ = sin(θ + π/2)",
      "掌握余弦曲线的关键特征点（波峰、零点、波谷）及平移性质"
    ],
    "teaching_strategies": [
      "基于单位圆投影动态演示余弦值的几何意涵",
      "采用双曲线并排对比演示波形形状的一致性与平移相位差",
      "交互式寻找波峰与零点强化对特殊角的记忆"
    ],
    "numbers": [
      {
        "initial": 0,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 6.28,
        "label": "旋转角度 θ",
        "unit": "rad",
        "student_control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.031400000000000004
        }
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "purpose": "建立单位圆中动点 x 轴投影表示余弦值 cos θ 的几何直觉",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "visual",
            "capability": "unit_circle_projection"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "在单位圆中，当动点 P 沿着圆周旋转时，它在 x 轴上的横坐标投影长度，就代表了该角度的余弦值 cos θ。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "visual",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "content": {
                  "capability": "unit_circle_projection",
                  "parameters": {
                    "title": "单位圆与 x 轴投影",
                    "projection": "cos"
                  },
                  "numbers": [
                    1
                  ]
                },
                "role": "main_visual",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "new_region"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "观察动点 P 在 x 轴上的横坐标投影",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "注意看，随着角度 θ 的改变，x 轴上的投影红线长度也在实时跟着变化。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 1.57,
                "duration_intent": "normal",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "从单位圆旋转推导余弦曲线 y = cos θ 的关键点变化与展开过程",
        "reusable_items": [],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "在单位圆中，动点 P 的横坐标代表余弦值 cos θ。当我们旋转动点，注意看它在 x 轴上的投影长度变化。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "观察动点P在x轴上的投影与余弦值的对应关系",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "reusable",
                  "section": 1,
                  "item": 1
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "当 θ = 0 时，投影在最右侧，横坐标达到最大值 1。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 0,
                "duration_intent": "brief",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "随着逆时针旋转，在 θ = π/2 时，投影回到原点，横坐标降为 0。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 1.57,
                "duration_intent": "normal",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "继续旋转至 θ = π 时，投影到达最左侧，横坐标达到最低值 -1。将这一过程在平面直角坐标系中展开，就得到了余弦曲线 y = cos θ。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 3.14,
                "duration_intent": "extended",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "对比正余弦波形，推导平移关系与诱导公式 cos θ = sin(θ + π/2)",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "visual",
            "capability": "function_plot"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "大家请看单位圆，动点 P 在圆周上运动，其在 x 轴上的投影坐标正好对应着 cos θ 的数值。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "引导观察动点P在x轴上的投影位置",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "现在我们将余弦曲线 y 等于 cos x 与正弦曲线 y 等于 sin x 绘制在同一个坐标系中进行对比。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "visual",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "content": {
                  "capability": "function_plot",
                  "parameters": {
                    "title": "正弦与余弦曲线对比",
                    "curve_labels": [
                      "y = cos x",
                      "y = sin x"
                    ],
                    "expressions": [
                      "cos(x)",
                      "sin(x)"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "role": "comparison_visual",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "right_of",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "distinct_visual": true
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "y = \\cos x, \\quad y = \\sin x"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "对比两条曲线可以发现，它们的波形形状完全相同。余弦曲线的波峰在 x 等于 0 时出现，比正弦曲线提前了二分之派个单位。几何上，这相当于将正弦图像整体向左平移了二分之派个单位。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "local_board_item",
                  "moment": 2,
                  "item": 1
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 1.57,
                "duration_intent": "extended",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "由此可知，余弦函数与正弦函数满足关系式 cos θ 等于 sin(θ 加二分之派)。这就是著名的诱导公式。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "\\cos\\theta = \\sin\\left(\\theta + \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "请你试着拖动滑块，观察旋转角度 θ 在不同区间内余弦值的波峰与零点变化情况。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 4,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ],
                "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
                "timing": "after_speech"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "student_activities": [
          {
            "kind": "number_target",
            "prompt": "拖动角度滑块至约 1.57 rad (π/2)，观察此时余弦曲线对应的零点。",
            "hints": [
              "将角度 θ 调整到 1.57 左右",
              "注意观察余弦曲线 y = cos θ 在该点的值为 0"
            ],
            "success_message": "很好！此时 cos(π/2) = 0，正好对应余弦曲线的零点。",
            "hint_after_attempts": 2,
            "number_controls": [
              {
                "number": 1,
                "controls": [
                  "slider",
                  "geometry_point"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "value": 1.57,
            "tolerance": 0.015700000000000002
          }
        ]
      },
